The bending direction and bending strength of the hair vinegar are all called rules, so keep it at 0 or enter 0.05 here.

110
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Next, let's look at the hair vinegar details.

111
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:40,000
The previous four parameters can be set according to the direction of the hair vinegar.

112
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,000
